	<!-- ── FAQ ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
	<section class="page-section" id="faq">
		<h2>Common questions</h2>
		<div class="learn-faq">
			<div class="learn-faq-item">
				<h3>What does it cost?</h3>
				<p>We work that out with you once we have talked. It depends on the race, where it is, and how many of us come.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="learn-faq-item">
				<h3>Do I pay for travel?</h3>
				<p>Travel is part of the same conversation. Nothing is fixed, and we would rather agree it with you than put a number on a page.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="learn-faq-item">
				<h3>Can I choose who comes?</h3>
				<p>Tell us if you have a preference. Once we have your date we will tell you who is free, and whether that is one of us or all three.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="learn-faq-item">
				<h3>Can you work alongside my own crew?</h3>
				<p>Yes, and it is often the best setup. We are happy to work alongside whichever family and friends you want there, with clear roles agreed in advance.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="learn-faq-item">
				<h3>Where do you crew?</h3>
				<p>In principle, anywhere. We are based in Europe, so tell us where your race is and we will be straight with you about what is realistic.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="learn-faq-item">
				<h3>What if you say no?</h3>
				<p>We will tell you why, and point you at the free <a href="/learn/crewing-tips/">crewing tips</a> so your own crew can run a tighter race.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

